CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --apply-loop-contracts
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^\[check\.assertion\.\d+\] line \d+ assertion \*saved->q == 0: FAILURE$
--
--
Checks that storing an address in a field of a local struct whose own address
escaped (before the loop) escapes it: `check` reads the previous iteration's
`t` through `saved`, so `t` is not a loop local.
